[*] GTKWave save file for tb_harvard_top running basic: data-side memory control.
[*]   gtkwave build/tb_harvard_top_basic.vcd memctrl.gtkw      (run in sim/ after make harvard)
[*] Interesting window: about 75 ns - 205 ns (cycle k runs from 15+10k ns to 25+10k ns).
[*]   ~75 ns     : SW to data RAM         -> sel_ram=1, ram_we=1
[*]   ~85 ns     : LW from data RAM       -> d_rdata = 0000000C
[*]   ~115 ns    : ADDI (no access)       -> addr_fault=1 but d_fault=0 (fault only on an access)
[*]   ~155 ns    : SW to 0x808 (invalid)  -> addr_fault=1, d_fault=1, ram_we stays 0
[*]   ~165 ns    : LW from 0x808          -> d_fault=1, d_rdata=0
[*]   ~175 ns    : SW to 0x400            -> sel_io=1, io_we=1, out_port becomes 0000000C
[*]   ~185 ns    : LW from 0x400          -> d_rdata=0 (out_port is write-only)
